OL,3,GNEWSAFriends and fitness motivate
OL,4,Amarathon runners
OL,5,
OL,6,FRunners from around the world are
OL,7,Fgearing up to take part in the 21st
OL,8,FJersey Marathon.
OL,10,FOrganisers said runners as young as six
OL,11,Fand older than 75 from 19 different
OL,12,Fcountries would be taking part on
OL,13,FSunday.
OL,15,FRoad closures or restrictions would be
OL,16,Fin place from 07:30 to 16:00 BST in St
OL,17,FHelier, St Lawrence, St John, St Mary,
OL,18,FSt Ouen, St Peter and St Brelade, they
OL,19,Fsaid.
